    <value>To read your Outlook calendar groups (teams, rooms, personal groups), the application must be authorized once to access Exchange Online.

1. Click "Open the authorization page" and accept in your browser (the page ends on a blank page, this is normal).
2. Come back and click "I authorized: retry".

If Microsoft says an administrator must approve the application, forward the request: the import will only work after approval.</value>
